                      </div>
                      <div class="entry-content m-0 p-0">
                        <p>You don’t have to quit your job to finish school. Flexible adult education classes can help you prepare for the GED to earn your <strong>Kansas State High School Diploma</strong> while working.</p>
                        <p><i class="fa fa-arrow-alt-circle-right"></i> <a href="ssc/aep/index.html">Learn more about the Adult Education Program</a></p>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
